WEBVTT

00:10:28.600 --> 00:10:31.496
Now, if you're sitting out here
in the audience and you said,

00:10:31.520 --> 00:10:33.936
"Oh yeah, well, that ain't me
and I don't buy it,"

00:10:33.960 --> 00:10:35.256
then come take my class --

00:10:35.280 --> 00:10:36.976
(Laughter)

00:10:37.000 --> 00:10:40.680
so I can show you how much money
it costs you every time you get emotional.

00:10:41.960 --> 00:10:45.120
(Applause)

00:10:47.600 --> 00:10:49.136
Thank you very much. Thank you.

00:10:49.160 --> 00:10:50.320
(Applause)